  "summary": "A STarKos song player, self-modifying (its variables are its own instructions' operands): Init with DE = the song, Play once a frame, Stop, from a jump table at +0, +3, +6. Its period table is STarKos's 1 MHz one, so on a 128K a song sounds 9.9 semitones higher.",
